WEBVTT

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:23.220
Before I knew it, I abandoned happiness to survive

00:00:23.890 --> 00:00:30.360
Lying to myself, I danced clinging on to illusions

00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:37.040
At the edge of my vision when I close my eyes

00:00:37.430 --> 00:00:43.000
I was searching for your smile

00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:50.370
With our memories fading

00:00:50.910 --> 00:00:57.450
We hold on to our dreams and run  Yeah

00:00:57.780 --> 00:01:04.350
These feelings that I shut away in my heart

00:01:04.890 --> 00:01:11.580
I'll now grasp them again

00:01:32.110 --> 00:01:35.870
Kaiba, you finally played your ace, Blue-Eyes!

00:01:35.870 --> 00:01:39.560
But I won't lose so easily!

00:01:39.560 --> 00:01:44.060
By using my Graverobber and Monster Reborn combo, Blue-Eyes belongs to me!

00:01:44.060 --> 00:01:44.970
What?

00:01:44.970 --> 00:01:48.650
You summoned another Blue-Eyes so that they'll destroy each other?

00:01:48.650 --> 00:01:50.800
You must be desperate!

00:01:50.800 --> 00:01:56.030
Oh no!  I used Monster Reborn to take his Blue-Eyes, but he took it back!

00:01:56.030 --> 00:02:02.030
Road to Becoming a True Duelist

00:02:10.730 --> 00:02:12.500
How's that, Jonouchi?

00:02:12.500 --> 00:02:18.050
Now that Blue-Eyes is back to its rightful owner, you can no longer escape.

00:02:18.320 --> 00:02:21.050
And you still won't admit defeat?

00:02:22.080 --> 00:02:24.000
I'll never admit that!

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:26.920
I told you that I'll never give up!

00:02:26.920 --> 00:02:28.880
Here I go!  I draw!

00:02:28.880 --> 00:02:34.080
I don't have a monster strong enough to defeat Blue-Eyes's 3000 attack points.

00:02:34.080 --> 00:02:36.070
But if I get that card...

00:02:36.730 --> 00:02:38.800
I'm counting on you for then!

00:02:39.170 --> 00:02:42.400
I summon Baby Dragon in defense position!

00:02:44.050 --> 00:02:45.510
I end my turn!

00:02:45.840 --> 00:02:47.800
He was playing so well.

00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:50.880
Is there nothing he can do?

00:02:50.880 --> 00:02:53.660
There still has to be a way.

00:02:53.660 --> 00:02:54.750
Right, Yugi?

00:02:55.840 --> 00:02:58.640
Huh?  Where did Yugi go?

00:02:58.640 --> 00:03:01.130
Anzu isn't back either.

00:03:05.520 --> 00:03:08.160
I know I'm being selfish.

00:03:08.160 --> 00:03:11.870
But I still want you to save my brother, Marik.

00:03:14.740 --> 00:03:21.510
It's unforgivable that Marik formed the Ghouls and hurt many people.

00:03:21.510 --> 00:03:27.570
But that's because he was misled by the Ishtar family's destiny.

00:03:27.570 --> 00:03:30.250
I wanted to save him.

00:03:30.250 --> 00:03:32.890
He's my only brother.

00:03:33.720 --> 00:03:34.890
Ishizu...

00:03:35.100 --> 00:03:40.130
You're the only one who can defeat his dark personality and save Marik.

00:03:41.040 --> 00:03:44.130
Please save him.

00:03:44.340 --> 00:03:45.950
My other self...

00:03:45.950 --> 00:03:52.520
The gravekeepers have protected the Millennium Items and the Pharaoh's memories.

00:03:52.520 --> 00:03:54.720
Those are my lost memories.

00:03:55.620 --> 00:03:58.840
That's why Marik hated me.

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:01.150
That means I'm also to blame.

00:04:01.370 --> 00:04:05.890
I'll duel him in the finals and defeat his dark side.

00:04:06.160 --> 00:04:08.510
I'll save Marik from the shadows.

00:04:08.510 --> 00:04:12.630
And save Mai and Bakura since they lost their Shadow Games.

00:04:14.270 --> 00:04:15.630
Thank you.

00:04:20.220 --> 00:04:20.940
Huh?

00:04:20.940 --> 00:04:21.640
Anzu!

00:04:21.640 --> 00:04:23.770
What happened?

00:04:23.770 --> 00:04:25.060
Why am I here?

00:04:25.060 --> 00:04:26.540
You don't remember?

00:04:26.540 --> 00:04:27.650
Umm...

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:33.150
I remember Jonouchi and Kaiba starting their duel, but...

00:04:38.200 --> 00:04:39.880
His back is against the wall!

00:04:39.880 --> 00:04:45.860
Yeah.  Since Jonouchi's monsters are in defense, he won't lose life points.

00:04:45.860 --> 00:04:47.780
But he can't attack either.

00:04:47.970 --> 00:04:49.870
My turn!  I draw!

00:04:50.980 --> 00:04:53.370
Your luck has run out!

00:04:53.370 --> 00:04:54.400
What?

00:04:54.400 --> 00:04:57.140
The spell card, Stop Defense!

00:05:00.820 --> 00:05:02.420
Oh no!  He'll lose!

00:05:02.420 --> 00:05:04.660
All right!  My brother wins!

00:05:04.660 --> 00:05:07.800
Destroy the scrub, Blue-Eyes!

00:05:07.800 --> 00:05:09.930
Attack Hayabusa Knight!

00:05:10.840 --> 00:05:13.780
Burst Stream of Destruction!

00:05:21.200 --> 00:05:22.570
It's over!

00:05:29.410 --> 00:05:30.610
Now!

00:05:30.610 --> 00:05:32.510
I flip over my set card!

00:05:32.870 --> 00:05:33.610
What?

00:05:33.610 --> 00:05:36.610
Nutrient Z!

00:05:36.610 --> 00:05:40.120
When I take at least 2000 points of damage...

00:05:40.120 --> 00:05:44.450
...I regain 4000 life points before subtracting my life points!

00:05:45.370 --> 00:05:48.270
Nice!  Jonouchi is tough!

00:05:48.270 --> 00:05:51.360
His stubbornness is his strength!

00:05:51.940 --> 00:05:53.860
You won't beat me that easily!

00:05:54.160 --> 00:05:56.870
You don't know when to give up.

00:05:57.100 --> 00:05:59.700
I set a card and end my turn!

00:05:59.920 --> 00:06:03.550
No matter what you do, you're still going to lose!

00:06:03.550 --> 00:06:05.620
I'll end you next turn!

00:06:09.050 --> 00:06:13.520
If he attacks me next time, I can't stop it.

00:06:13.520 --> 00:06:17.720
But a deck has infinite potential.

00:06:18.400 --> 00:06:20.720
Please!  Come to me!

00:06:20.720 --> 00:06:23.020
My turn!  I draw!

00:06:26.020 --> 00:06:27.370
All right!

00:06:27.370 --> 00:06:29.600
Here I go!  Time Wizard!

00:06:33.060 --> 00:06:34.600
Time Wizard?

00:06:34.820 --> 00:06:37.610
Kaiba!  This is my final big gamble!

00:06:37.610 --> 00:06:40.610
We'll see if my luck's run out!

00:06:40.880 --> 00:06:43.050
Activate Time Magic!

00:06:43.370 --> 00:06:44.860
Time Magic!

00:06:51.710 --> 00:06:53.260
Hit the mark!

00:06:53.260 --> 00:06:55.290
Jonouchi wins if he hits the mark!

00:06:56.840 --> 00:06:58.040
Brother...

00:07:10.040 --> 00:07:12.310
Yeah!  I hit the mark!

00:07:21.550 --> 00:07:28.590
A thousand years pass, so my Baby Dragon evolves into Thousand Dragon!

00:07:35.560 --> 00:07:39.570
And Kaiba!  All your monsters are destroyed!

00:07:39.930 --> 00:07:42.810
Vanish into time, Blue-Eyes!

00:07:45.700 --> 00:07:48.880
His persistence has paid off.

00:07:48.880 --> 00:07:51.640
But it won't work on me.

00:07:55.880 --> 00:07:57.050
Did I do it?

00:07:57.050 --> 00:07:58.260
All right!

00:07:58.260 --> 00:08:01.060
Blue-Eyes vanished beyond time.

00:08:01.280 --> 00:08:06.000
You fool!  Return to me, Blue-Eyes!

00:08:10.800 --> 00:08:11.800
What?

00:08:11.800 --> 00:08:13.080
No way!

00:08:13.080 --> 00:08:14.160
Unbelievable!

00:08:14.920 --> 00:08:15.540
What's that?

00:08:17.100 --> 00:08:20.040
I activated Interdimensional Matter Transporter.

00:08:20.260 --> 00:08:26.050
This card temporarily evacuates my monster to a safe location.

00:08:26.050 --> 00:08:28.050
To another dimension!

00:08:31.050 --> 00:08:32.790
That's my brother!

00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:35.290
Damn!  I thought he won!

00:08:35.290 --> 00:08:38.290
Your Gamble Deck relies on luck.

00:08:38.290 --> 00:08:41.100
You'll never defeat me that way!

00:08:45.320 --> 00:08:47.040
Impressive, Kaiba!

00:08:47.870 --> 00:08:49.350
Being a sore loser?

00:08:50.040 --> 00:08:53.460
No.  It's what I really believe, Kaiba.

00:08:53.460 --> 00:08:55.270
You're strong.

00:08:55.270 --> 00:08:58.270
It's exciting to duel a strong opponent.

00:08:58.270 --> 00:09:00.020
I'm having fun!

00:09:00.020 --> 00:09:01.050
Fun?

00:09:01.280 --> 00:09:05.550
Huh?  Why would you duel if you're not having fun?

00:09:05.800 --> 00:09:08.960
A scrub like you will never understand.

00:09:08.960 --> 00:09:12.280
I've conquered all by winning duels!

00:09:12.280 --> 00:09:14.360
Victory is everything to me!

00:09:14.800 --> 00:09:15.800
But...

00:09:24.670 --> 00:09:27.170
I don't want to understand you.

00:09:27.900 --> 00:09:30.370
There's no card I can play.

00:09:30.370 --> 00:09:31.580
I end my turn!

00:09:31.700 --> 00:09:34.030
I'll end this farce.

00:09:34.030 --> 00:09:36.480
My turn!  I draw!

00:09:37.850 --> 00:09:41.900
By discarding Thunder Dragon from my hand...

00:09:41.900 --> 00:09:46.830
...I can add two Thunder Dragons from my deck to my hand.

00:09:47.370 --> 00:09:49.970
Then the spell card, Polymerization!

00:09:54.120 --> 00:09:57.200
I fuse two Thunder Dragons!

00:10:02.660 --> 00:10:05.080
Twin-Headed Thunder Dragon!

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:08.120
I also activate Quick Attack!

00:10:10.460 --> 00:10:13.990
My Fusion Monster can attack this turn!

00:10:37.060 --> 00:10:38.980
Thanks, Yugi.

00:10:38.980 --> 00:10:40.480
Are you really OK?

00:10:40.720 --> 00:10:43.040
Yeah.  I'm totally fine.

00:10:43.040 --> 00:10:46.490
But it's freaky not to remember anything.

00:10:48.200 --> 00:10:52.720
My other self, why did Marik go after Anzu?

00:10:52.720 --> 00:10:54.500
I don't know.

00:10:55.920 --> 00:11:00.000
Hey, how's Jonouchi and Kaiba's duel going?

00:11:00.150 --> 00:11:01.130
Yeah...

00:11:01.600 --> 00:11:04.010
It should be ending soon.

00:11:11.760 --> 00:11:13.940
Twin-Headed Thunder Dragon!

00:11:13.940 --> 00:11:16.080
Attack Thousand Dragon!

00:11:22.770 --> 00:11:23.960
Thousand Dragon!

00:11:33.720 --> 00:11:37.540
Blue-Eyes!  Attack Jonouchi directly!

00:11:37.810 --> 00:11:40.540
Burst Stream of Destruction!

00:12:01.550 --> 00:12:03.160
Brother!  You won!

00:12:03.380 --> 00:12:08.440
Jonouchi!  You tried your best, but you're no match for my brother!

00:12:09.260 --> 00:12:13.200
Winning a duel you're supposed to win isn't satisfying.

00:12:13.200 --> 00:12:15.180
What a waste of time.

00:12:19.080 --> 00:12:20.830
Wait, Kaiba!

00:12:20.830 --> 00:12:21.680
Jonouchi?

00:12:22.670 --> 00:12:26.190
What is it?  I won't listen to a loser whine.

00:12:26.840 --> 00:12:29.190
I admit defeat.

00:12:30.480 --> 00:12:32.000
But that's only for now!

00:12:34.120 --> 00:12:36.180
I'll defeat you someday!

00:12:36.180 --> 00:12:38.740
I'll keep fighting you.

00:12:38.740 --> 00:12:42.240
Every time I lose, I'll crawl back up and challenge you again!

00:12:42.240 --> 00:12:45.010
That's my road to becoming a true duelist!

00:12:45.970 --> 00:12:48.510
Nothing can cure a fool.

00:12:48.720 --> 00:12:50.250
Say what!

00:12:50.250 --> 00:12:51.960
Knock it off, Jonouchi!

00:12:52.220 --> 00:12:55.520
Yugi's final match is about to start!

00:12:55.520 --> 00:12:57.380
Oh yeah.

00:12:57.380 --> 00:13:02.390
Huh?  Yugi and Anzu already left without watching my duel?

00:13:02.660 --> 00:13:03.970
Let's go.

00:13:03.970 --> 00:13:06.510
Sheesh, some friends they are.

00:13:06.510 --> 00:13:08.510
I was dueling so well.

00:13:11.770 --> 00:13:13.080
Let's go, Mokuba.

00:13:13.080 --> 00:13:15.310
My Battle City is over.

00:13:16.080 --> 00:13:19.010
But Brother, there's still the final match.

00:13:19.010 --> 00:13:22.010
That means nothing now.

00:13:25.510 --> 00:13:26.680
Ishizu.

00:13:27.500 --> 00:13:32.140
Seto, even though Yugi has two God Cards...

00:13:32.140 --> 00:13:35.520
...you don't think he can defeat Marik's Ra Deck.

00:13:36.360 --> 00:13:39.530
His chances are minuscule.

00:13:39.760 --> 00:13:43.480
The Ra card is that powerful.

00:13:44.150 --> 00:13:46.910
But it doesn't concern me anymore.

00:13:46.910 --> 00:13:50.040
I don't care who wins.

00:13:50.370 --> 00:13:54.540
Yugi needs your help to win, Seto.

00:13:55.620 --> 00:13:58.020
What nonsense is that?

00:13:58.020 --> 00:14:01.800
Another message from your occult items?

00:14:01.800 --> 00:14:03.100
Mokuba, let's go.

00:14:03.100 --> 00:14:04.020
O-Okay.

00:14:04.720 --> 00:14:06.550
Pereto Kelto.

00:14:08.960 --> 00:14:15.560
Seto, you know the meaning of the inscriptions on that tablet.

00:14:19.460 --> 00:14:23.840
The 3,000 year-old tablet was found in the Pharaoh's funeral shrine.

00:14:24.680 --> 00:14:31.440
Enscribed in ancient text was Pereto Kelto, a prayer to the dead.

00:14:32.000 --> 00:14:36.450
Those inscriptions were dedicated to his friend, the deceased Pharaoh.

00:14:37.200 --> 00:14:38.350
Nonsense.

00:14:38.350 --> 00:14:45.960
The priest on the tablet was the one who created the tablet as a symbol of friendship.

00:14:46.750 --> 00:14:48.260
Corpses rest.

00:14:48.910 --> 00:14:51.740
Vessels become sand and dust.

00:14:51.740 --> 00:14:56.140
Even gold and swords are sheathed in time.

00:14:56.940 --> 00:14:59.600
The corpse lacks the Pharaoh's name.

00:14:59.600 --> 00:15:02.450
Time is the soul's battlefield.

00:15:02.820 --> 00:15:05.600
I shout the song of battle.

00:15:05.600 --> 00:15:07.010
The song of a friend.

00:15:07.600 --> 00:15:12.020
Lead me to the distant location where souls meet.

00:15:12.480 --> 00:15:14.820
What are you trying to say, Ishizu?

00:15:14.820 --> 00:15:19.820
I don't care about text from 3,000 year-old relics!

00:15:19.820 --> 00:15:25.980
Seto, the God Cards guided you to start Battle City.

00:15:25.980 --> 00:15:30.910
And you brought an end to your fight at the Duel Tower.

00:15:31.120 --> 00:15:33.540
By battling the Pharaoh's soul.

00:15:34.170 --> 00:15:36.360
Pharaoh?  How silly.

00:15:36.360 --> 00:15:40.050
If you continue with this nonsense, you'll regret it!

00:15:40.410 --> 00:15:43.260
Be honest with yourself, Seto.

00:15:43.260 --> 00:15:48.050
Your Duel Tower is where souls meet.

00:15:48.450 --> 00:15:52.790
A battle sanctuary that your soul built!

00:15:53.100 --> 00:15:55.140
It's no sanctuary!

00:15:55.140 --> 00:15:59.370
The Duel Tower symbolizes my hatred towards Gozaburo!

00:15:59.370 --> 00:16:02.910
I was supposed to stand at its top as the Duel King...

00:16:02.910 --> 00:16:06.310
...to prove that I've conquered everything!

00:16:06.520 --> 00:16:09.810
But it means nothing now.

00:16:09.810 --> 00:16:13.060
I will sink it into the ocean!

00:16:13.060 --> 00:16:17.780
Mokuba, start the detonator's timer in the basement!

00:16:21.280 --> 00:16:23.290
What's wrong?  Hurry up and go.

00:16:23.520 --> 00:16:31.530
Brother. we don't need to drag Yugi and his friends into our anger and hate.

00:16:32.380 --> 00:16:33.320
Mokuba?

00:16:33.530 --> 00:16:37.620
I really hated them in the beginning.

00:16:37.620 --> 00:16:41.650
But they fought for me on Pegasus's island.

00:16:41.650 --> 00:16:45.060
They also saved me from the Ghouls.

00:16:45.300 --> 00:16:50.380
They treated me like their friend.

00:16:50.860 --> 00:16:52.280
Mokuba...

00:16:53.360 --> 00:16:57.190
I think what Yugi and Jonouchi said is true.

00:16:57.880 --> 00:17:02.380
A duelists' battle isn't just between the monsters in the cards.

00:17:02.380 --> 00:17:06.800
There's anger, hate and greed in our hearts.

00:17:06.800 --> 00:17:09.600
The enemy is also inside us!

00:17:10.000 --> 00:17:16.010
Overcoming them will open the path to becoming a true duelist!

00:17:19.150 --> 00:17:21.250
Impressive, Kaiba!

00:17:22.110 --> 00:17:23.680
Being a sore loser?

00:17:24.250 --> 00:17:27.880
No.  It's what I really believe, Kaiba.

00:17:27.880 --> 00:17:29.970
You're strong.

00:17:29.970 --> 00:17:33.110
It's exciting to duel a strong opponent.

00:17:33.110 --> 00:17:34.490
I'm having fun!

00:17:34.490 --> 00:17:36.910
You used to feel the same!

00:17:36.910 --> 00:17:41.000
You used to love playing games!

00:17:41.600 --> 00:17:45.570
I loved how you smiled back then!

00:17:45.570 --> 00:17:46.510
Mokuba...

00:17:47.000 --> 00:17:48.650
Please, Brother!

00:17:48.650 --> 00:17:55.510
Promise me that sinking the Duel Tower will erase your hate!

00:17:55.510 --> 00:17:58.840
I want you to be how you used to be.

00:18:01.080 --> 00:18:04.200
Can I give up my hate?

00:18:04.440 --> 00:18:08.310
Even if I sink the Duel Tower into the ocean...

00:18:10.400 --> 00:18:13.430
Jonouchi!  Is the duel over?

00:18:13.640 --> 00:18:15.400
You're horrible!

00:18:15.400 --> 00:18:18.500
Leaving in the middle of my duel?

00:18:18.500 --> 00:18:20.740
Sorry, Jonouchi.

00:18:20.740 --> 00:18:22.440
It's fine!

00:18:22.440 --> 00:18:27.700
It'll do you no good to watch this guy lose before your important finals.

00:18:27.920 --> 00:18:29.160
Say what!

00:18:29.740 --> 00:18:31.680
Jonouchi lost?

00:18:32.000 --> 00:18:33.700
That's right.

00:18:33.700 --> 00:18:36.830
But he did pretty well.

00:18:37.930 --> 00:18:40.690
But he was no match for Kaiba.

00:18:40.690 --> 00:18:44.060
Oh well.  Jonouchi still has much to improve.

00:18:44.300 --> 00:18:48.770
Be quiet!  You didn't see how awesome I was, so you have no right to talk!

00:18:49.020 --> 00:18:50.620
Don't need to watch to know.

00:18:50.620 --> 00:18:51.480
Hey!

00:18:54.150 --> 00:18:55.800
It's my turn.

00:19:10.680 --> 00:19:11.790
Marik.

00:19:12.880 --> 00:19:14.790
I'm looking forward to this, Yugi.

00:19:14.790 --> 00:19:18.800
Our duel will be the ultimate Shadow Game.

00:19:19.080 --> 00:19:21.110
I'll tear you apart.

00:19:21.110 --> 00:19:25.020
You'll enjoy experiencing death.

00:19:29.120 --> 00:19:32.310
Yugi, he's very dangerous.

00:19:32.560 --> 00:19:38.320
Before defeating his opponent in a duel, he enjoys torturing his opponent.

00:19:40.130 --> 00:19:41.320
Even Mai...

00:19:42.340 --> 00:19:46.830
I couldn't save Mai because I wasn't good enough.

00:19:47.040 --> 00:19:49.160
So I'm counting on you, Yugi.

00:19:49.160 --> 00:19:52.280
Defeat Marik and save Mai!

00:19:52.280 --> 00:19:53.570
I promise!

00:19:53.570 --> 00:19:58.400
By defeating Kaiba, Yugi has two God Cards.

00:19:58.400 --> 00:20:01.400
But they're powerless against my Ra.

00:20:01.400 --> 00:20:03.370
One Turn Kill.

00:20:03.370 --> 00:20:06.080
You'll die in an instant.

00:20:10.000 --> 00:20:14.590
Against Ra, Yugi's chances of winning are 3%.

00:20:14.800 --> 00:20:16.400
One Turn Kill.

00:20:16.400 --> 00:20:21.090
Ra's secret ability is much stronger than the other two God Cards.

00:20:21.440 --> 00:20:25.020
But I have one key card.

00:20:25.240 --> 00:20:29.900
The only card that can seal away Ra's ability.

00:20:30.100 --> 00:20:33.650
Even if Yugi had this card in his hand...

00:20:33.650 --> 00:20:37.410
...his chances of winning only increase to 20%.

00:20:38.580 --> 00:20:40.380
Brother, where are you going?

00:20:40.600 --> 00:20:42.480
To the Duel Arena in the sky.

00:20:45.420 --> 00:20:49.460
How fun.  A 20% game.

00:20:56.800 --> 00:21:01.220
He said his friends brought him victory.

00:21:01.900 --> 00:21:05.650
This card will give you a small chance.

00:21:06.000 --> 00:21:09.040
Yugi, I'll give this to you.

00:21:14.980 --> 00:21:17.480
Can you create a miracle?

00:21:32.730 --> 00:21:34.200
There are no miracles!

00:21:34.200 --> 00:21:36.200
There is no power of friendship!

00:21:36.200 --> 00:21:38.560
Take this, Yugi!

00:21:40.680 --> 00:21:43.470
Your defeat will prove that!

00:21:58.200 --> 00:22:02.020
What?  Kaiba gave Yugi a card?

00:22:02.020 --> 00:22:04.090
What's he scheming?

00:22:04.300 --> 00:22:09.770
But Yugi puts that card into his deck without any suspicion.

00:22:10.000 --> 00:22:13.880
Battle City's final match finally begins.

00:22:13.880 --> 00:22:19.880
Is there any way to fight the effects of Marik's God Card, The Winged Dragon of Ra?

00:22:19.880 --> 00:22:22.280
Please do your best, Yugi!

00:22:22.280 --> 00:22:25.600
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Final Match  Yugi vs Marik

00:22:25.600 --> 00:22:27.140
Duel, standby!

00:22:33.470 --> 00:22:42.380
The streets flow by, colored in red

00:22:42.880 --> 00:22:50.720
If you notice your pain, it changes to joy

00:22:52.450 --> 00:23:01.880
People learn of friendship every time they wipe their tears

00:23:02.500 --> 00:23:11.400
With the warm strength you gave me, I'll change them into kindness

00:23:11.970 --> 00:23:20.430
My overflowing emotions don't stop

00:23:21.210 --> 00:23:25.940
I'll live feeling them

00:23:26.550 --> 00:23:31.120
For me to be me

00:23:31.120 --> 00:23:39.580
Overflowing friendship heals me

00:23:40.260 --> 00:23:45.220
Our chance meeting was real

00:23:45.740 --> 00:23:54.880
We'll both understand that someday
